LearningAgreement ..> AgreementIntegrationEvent : confirmByHost / cancel
legend bottom left
  CF08 / BR-08: confirmHost, not faculty approval alone.
  Agreement + audit + append(event) commit atomically.
  HOST_CONFIRMED / CANCELLED identify the integration events.
  Dispatcher publishes after commit; marks published after broker confirmation.
  Retry is at-least-once and may deliver duplicates.
endlegend

LearningAgreementRepoJPA -[hidden]right-> OutboxRepoJPA
